{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/616_CuriosityKilledtheCat__1_.png?t=1740371756\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leap and climb through a perilous labyrinth of obstacles, all to find your way back home.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each jump demanding precision and persistence, you must navigate through difficult platforming levels, testing your feline reflexes and determination. While falling can be a setback, take comfort in the fact that cats have nine lives. However, beware, cats that use up their lives may experience unintended consequences... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/RunLeap.png?t=1740371756\" /><strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/Jumping_Pillars_Small.gif?t=1740371756\" /><strong>   <br> </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/Res_Recover.png?t=1740371756\" /><strong><br>  </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/Cafe_Rest.gif?t=1740371756\" /><strong>   <br> </strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/Maneuver.png?t=1740371756\" /><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/Wall_Running.gif?t=1740371756\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/Paws_full.png?t=1740371756\" /></p>","background":"https://st